The Fee Management is a WordPress plugin to manage school and its entities such as classes, sections, students, ID cards, teachers, staff, fees, invoices, noticeboard and much more.

== Description ==

### What does Fee Management do?

* Add classes. Assign classes to school. Add sections.
* Add different types of subjects and assign teachers.
* Add students
* Add school teacher to manage students. Add accountant to manage fee invoices and payments.
* Add school admins, staff with permissions to manage the school.
* Fee Invoice Generation, Payment Collection.


== Installation ==

Go to *Dashboad | Plugins | Add New* and search for **Fee Management**. Then install and activate the plugin.

